</style><div class="fluid-engine fe-6a1f2af75f96636c6347630d"><div class="fe-block fe-block-40fe9049b54e60bde71b"><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.html" data-sqsp-block="text" data-website-component-id="40fe9049b54e60bde71b" id="block-40fe9049b54e60bde71b"><div class="sqs-block-content"><div class="sqs-text-block-container">
  
  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h2 style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h2><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">How long are the guided tutorials?</h3><pre><code>The short video tutorials are about 3-5 minutes per recipe. Certain videos consolidate a few related activities into one.</code></pre><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Can I view these tutorials on my mobile phone?</h3><pre><code>Yes. Our platform is extremely mobile friendly and you will be able to access all guided tutorials and recipes easily on your phone.  Download the Teachable app to access from iOS or Android.</code></pre><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Do you provide printable recipes?</h3><pre><code>Yes. You can print all guided and alternative recipes to have easy access and enjoy screen-free time with your children.</code></pre><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Are these recipes taste safe?</h3><pre><code>Yes. Many recipes are taste-safe and/or baby friendly and these are easily identifiable within the resource modules and printables.</code></pre><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">What ages are these sensory play tutorials for?</h3><pre><code>The benefits of sensory play are ageless. This resource hopes to inspire play for most stages of child development, including babies, toddlers and older children. Recipes do not offer specific age&nbsp;appropriateness&nbsp;given the independent development of each child. Nevertheless, recipes that are baby-safe, taste-safe and gluten-free will be easily identifiable.</code></pre><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Do you offer refunds?</h3><pre><code>Due to the instant download of this resource and its printables, we do not offer refunds. For any related questions, please contact us at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:support@mothercould.com" target="_blank">support@mothercould.com</a>.</code></pre></div>


  
